The library and optional command-line tools are experimental read-only readers.
The cli feature builds the multi-call binary for fs.exfat and fsck.exfat.
fsck.exfat is check-only. No formatter, repair operation or writable mode exists.
Validated only against macOS on images macOS formatted, never a Windows-formatted image.
A raw device with 4096-byte sectors cannot be read. A file over 1,048,576 clusters is refused.
